  → ]8;;vscode://file//Users/pedronauck/Dev/compozy/agh/internal/daemon/boot.go:1893internal/daemon/boot.go:1893]8;;

  Guard the marketplace dependency when bootMarketplace is skipped
  (internal/daemon/boot.go:1893)
  bootMarketplace can return early when the marketplace repository is
  missing, leaving state.marketplace nil. Wiring that into MCPCatalog
  creates a typed-nil interface, so the s.mcpCatalog == nil guard won’t
  fire and installs fail with a generic load error instead of
  ErrUnavailable. Leave the dependency unset or gate this assignment when
  the marketplace runtime isn’t started.

