  Restore overwritten secrets when the mutation fails.

  PutSecret updates existing canonical refs, but compensation only deletes
  refs marked newRef. If a later write or config commit fails, the
  operation returns an error while earlier existing secrets remain modified.

  Use transactional/staged writes or retain enough prior state to restore
  overwritten refs during rollback.


